<section class="section" id="framework">
  <div class="wrap-wide">
    <div class="wrap" style="padding:0;">
      <p class="eyebrow">The framework</p>
      <h2>Five places meaning gets lost.</h2>
      <p>Every gap between what you mean and what lands is usually one of five. Most people only ever have one or two active at a time.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="five-grid">
      <div class="five-card"><h3>Structure</h3><p>You know the point, but it doesn't arrive in an order anyone can follow.</p></div>
      <div class="five-card"><h3>Thinking</h3><p>Your logic isn't visible, so a good conclusion reads as opinion.</p></div>
      <div class="five-card"><h3>Precision</h3><p>Too many words doing the work of too few ideas.</p></div>
      <div class="five-card"><h3>Impact</h3><p>Technically clear, but forgettable.</p></div>
      <div class="five-card"><h3>Connection</h3><p>Accurate, but not aimed at the person in front of you.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
